{"id":"660218","name":"贝贝南瓜焖饭","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/660218/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"贝贝南瓜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"五花肉（前腿肉）","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香菇","amount":"适量"},{"name":"腊肠","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"大米","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"香菇泡发洗净后切细。","img":"images/660218/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"贝贝南瓜洗净去籽后切块。","img":"images/660218/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"五花肉去皮洗净切薄片。","img":"images/660218/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"腊肠切薄片备用。","img":"images/660218/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"锅中热油放入香菇炒香后盛出。","img":"images/660218/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入腊肠炒香盛出。","img":"images/660218/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入五花肉翻炒出少许油脂。","img":"images/660218/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加入适量蚝油，生抽，老抽，盐翻炒均匀。","img":"images/660218/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放入贝贝南瓜。","img":"images/660218/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"翻炒均匀后把香菇一起炒匀。","img":"images/660218/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"大米清水淘洗干净。","img":"images/660218/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"加入平时煮米饭的水。","img":"images/660218/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"放入炒过的配料和腊肠。","img":"images/660218/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"电饭煲煮饭模式结束。","img":"images/660218/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"煮好的米饭翻拌均匀即可。","img":"images/660218/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/660218/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/660218/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/660218/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/660218/step_19.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电饭煲、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}